{"3164070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bros Survivors", "steam_appid": 3164070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN YOU COORDINATE WITH YOUR FRIEND?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bros Survivors is a co-op Horde Survivor where you must survive hordes of enemies. You and your friend can fuse into a giant mech! The challenge: controlling the colossus together. One handles vertical movement, and the other controls horizontal movement. In this game, learning to coordinate your moves is the absolute key to making it through the rounds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FUSE WITH YOUR FRIEND INTO A GIANT MECH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164070/extras/9b10ecc82ee78ea994281f022ea15bdb.poster.avif?t=1781366980\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164070/extras/9b10ecc82ee78ea994281f022ea15bdb.webm?t=1781366980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164070/extras/9b10ecc82ee78ea994281f022ea15bdb.mp4?t=1781366980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charge up:</strong> Defeat enemies to fill your fusion bar.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crash into each other:</strong> Coordinate a simultaneous Dash. If you crash into each other, you'll fuse into a giant mech.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared Control:</strong> Now you're much more powerful, but your control is shared. One player moves side to side (Horizontal Axis) and the other moves up and down (Vertical Axis).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Sounds simple? Try dodging massive hordes while your friend wants to go one way and you want to go the other!</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE HORDES OF ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164070/extras/6a469c64e73d99942f8b6066bd0c6079.poster.avif?t=1781366980\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164070/extras/6a469c64e73d99942f8b6066bd0c6079.webm?t=1781366980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164070/extras/6a469c64e73d99942f8b6066bd0c6079.mp4?t=1781366980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR POWERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164070/extras/92aa6032bfea5d98747a35c9180914f1.poster.avif?t=1781366980\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164070/extras/92aa6032bfea5d98747a35c9180914f1.webm?t=1781366980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164070/extras/92aa6032bfea5d98747a35c9180914f1.mp4?t=1781366980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT FINAL BOSSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164070/extras/f492e2e9a759d29085e7bb722e6c5d9d.poster.avif?t=1781366980\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps