b_paragraph\" ><strong>Total coordination:</strong> Fuse into a single, highly powerful character where one controls vertical movement and the other horizontal.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Co-op:</strong> Play with someone on the same couch (Local) or play online with anyone via Steam Remote Play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play your way:</strong> Full controller and keyboard support for each player.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat customization:</strong> Choose between auto or manual firing for each power.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Worlds and Final Bosses:</strong> Battle through apocalyptic, fantasy, and sci-fi stages. At the end of each, a boss awaits, demanding you and your friend stop fighting each other and finally learn how to pilot the fusion once and for all!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash Mechanic:</strong> Use it to close the gap, push enemies, or even &quot;annoy&quot; your friend.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frantic Action:</strong> Action-packed waves lasting from 20 to 90 seconds, swarming with enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression:</strong> Unlock characters with unique abilities and buy permanent upgrades in the shop.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Experience:</strong> Teamwork is essential; revive your partner at any time. No more getting bored waiting while you're dead!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexibility:</strong> Play solo and let a second player drop in at any point during the run.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>What are you waiting for? Fuse in this battle for survival!</i></strong></h2>", "about_the_game": 